YelpCamp 🌲🏕️

YelpCamp is a full-stack web application that allows users to explore, create, and review campgrounds. Users can register, log in, add new campgrounds with details, and share their experiences through reviews and ratings.

🚀 Live Demo

👉 https://yelpcamp-project-txs9.onrender.com

✨ Features

User authentication (Register / Login / Logout)

Create, edit, and delete campgrounds

Add reviews and ratings for campgrounds

Authorization to protect user actions

Responsive UI for better user experience

CRUD operations with database integration

🛠️ Tech Stack
Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, EJS
Backend: Node.js, Express.js
Database: MongoDB
Authentication: Passport.js
Deployment: Render

📚 Learning Outcomes
Implemented RESTful routing
Practiced full CRUD functionality
Gained hands-on experience with authentication & authorization
Learned database relationships using MongoDB & Mongoose
Understood deployment of full-stack applications
